    "en": "MRRKit brings MRR, ARR, revenue and subscribers from all your projects (Stripe, RevenueCat, Lemon Squeezy, Paddle, Polar, Gumroad, App Store Connect, Google Play) into one dashboard and widgets, on iPhone, iPad, Apple Watch, Android and Garmin. Notifications for every sale, 3-year projections, read-only keys stored on your iPhone. Free, Pro €9.99 once. (Figures shown are demo data.)"
